      "label": "\n\t\t\t\t<B>Requirement</B><BR/>\n\t\t\t\t<B>Brain Style Graph Navigation</B><BR/>\n\t\t\t\t<BR/>\n\t\t\t\tThe editor SHALL provide a central mind-map / TheBrain style view with the focus<BR/>ed card centered. The view SHALL show the parent (from the chosen shortest-path <BR/>chain), and MAY show siblings (same card_type) linked from that parent even if t<BR/>hey are not linked to the focused card.<BR/>\n\t\t\t",
