    {
      "_gvid": 1,
      "name": "REQ_012",
      "label": "\n\t\t\t\t<B>Requirement</B><BR/>\n\t\t\t\t<B>Edit, Preview, and Audit Inspector</B><BR/>\n\t\t\t\t<BR/>\n\t\t\t\tThe editor SHALL provide a right-pane inspector: the top half edits the focused <BR/>card; the bottom half renders a Markdown-style view of the card (including links<BR/>). The bottom half SHALL provide a tab to reveal the card’s audit trail details.<BR/>\n\t\t\t",
